    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Heritage Signature (RFI v1.0).</strong></p><p><em>&ldquo;It gets an opinion. You host it. You do not obey it.&rdquo;</em></p><p><strong>What&rsquo;s Inside You.</strong> 1/Soma Break, as an action: a humanoid within 30 ft who has lied (to you, to themselves, or to a third party) in the current scene must make a Resolve save (<strong>DC = 10 + your Presence + Soul</strong>) or be <strong>calmed</strong> by you for one minute. On a success they feel something brush past their teeth and know, briefly, that someone else tried to speak through your mouth.</p>",
